          The best high capacity power bank is the one sized to your daily watt-hour budget: around 20,000mAh for one person's phone through a long weekend outage, about 27,000mAh with laptop-class output for heavier use, and 50,000mAh or more only if it never needs to fly. Below are seven real options on Amazon and the simple math that turns mAh into outage days.
